  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo de la Infraestructura Vial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Infrastructure Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir con la mejora de la productividadmediante la provisin de infraestructura adecuada y de servicios de transporte seguros y confiables, permitiendo el acceso amercados y servicios sociales bsicos. Los objetivos especficos son contribuir a mejorar los niveles de servicio y la calidadde la red intervenida, a travs de obras de mejoramiento y rehabilitacin, que resultar en reduccin de costos de operacinvehicular y de tiempos promedio de recorrido, y el incremento del trfico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to help boost productivity by providing adequate infrastructure and safe and reliable transportation services and facilitating access to markets and basic social services. The specific objectives are to help improve the service and quality levels of the targeted network through improvement and rehabilitation works, with a view to reducing vehicle operating costs and average travel time and increasing traffic</narrative>
  </description>
